}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:06:42.234Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123005634?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/raisangoa","id":123005634,"login":"raisangoa","node_id":"U_kgDOB1Tqwg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raisangoa","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GovAlta/dcp-monorepo/commits/df107019c6b7521a83105633de21dc95e00e7358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:31:53Z","email":"123005634+raisangoa@users.noreply.github.com","name":"raisangoa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:31:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(design-system-mcp): fix collection filter returning 0 results and harden Dockerfile (#368)\n\nSearch with collection filter returned 0 because index.search fetched only\ntop-20 unfiltered candidates; if all 20 were from other collections, the\npost-filter result was empty. Fix: when collection is specified, fetch all\nindexed items before filtering.\n\nAlso ignore unrecognized collection values rather than silently returning\nempty, and add tool description hint to prevent LLMs from over-specifying\ncollection on discovery queries.\n\nDockerfile rewritten to copy compiled dist, install prod deps only, and\nrun as non-root user 1001.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16663e60cfe765063d8d79a49108f664b3f403ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GovAlta/dcp-monorepo/git/trees/16663e60cfe765063d8d79a49108f664b3f403ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GovAlta/dcp-monorepo/git/commits/df107019c6b7521a83105633de21dc95e00e7358","verification":{"payload":"tree 16663e60cfe765063d8d79a49108f664b3f403ad\nparent 8faa225355d46ebde9ab945f2cd09ab84605efde\nauthor raisangoa <123005634+raisangoa@users.noreply.github.com> 1788193913 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788193913 -0600\n\nfix(design-system-mcp): fix collection filter returning 0 results and harden Dockerfile (#368)\n\nSearch with collection filter returned 0 because index.search fetched only\ntop-20 unfiltered candidates; if all 20 were from other collections, the\npost-filter result was empty. Fix: when collection is specified, fetch all\nindexed items before filtering.\n\nAlso ignore unrecognized collection values rather than silently returning\nempty, and add tool description hint to prevent LLMs from over-specifying\ncollection on discovery queries.\n\nDockerfile rewritten to copy compiled dist, install prod deps only, and\nrun as non-root user 1001.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlax5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA640QAI7qghaFYLFUIkksACAm4qBS\nAyJ32o3IiqzPk0J2sn6d1KLvEWmeVMz8HCDiRXb/wUD+VdOzKTrnPaTlzNsQFlWP\nNsbQQOoCrI6qPdNp+fiSNFP8FiJNbGB5Np+CNrNsnaUe2orLvIrTXlW7HrMy7KX4\nF1VzsnPe/jXYgOOk68zCkDj6jINV1yNnflWhOHsO6JsLTy7vITNo5G0mobybieVo\nJh0L6J64JYnW4wPg7yXXoiLUSZNe6/imElcq/NyFCo/GZwYPkGi/GGzamLJJVX5n\nI8w6bcw9XR6hbhiUNMUiAMZcCi5k3ff9MH51pe1F5lxEGrbsG5UGoxFmidFOQhb3\nO+HDpBTttoQOYDQmZEGMDPEkdFI/uLDeZo2gBe2r0P4Oyr2w1WYgrayPalIcpgCi\nbAI6tSOXQcfyyAnYuhHZEbQN626zGyyiKNFnNpD/y7TPS4uB/jeIEBRAPY4o0X6+\nwUzGOCPsKrxBQif4ZRBbrVvIEhtvfLogW1nfH2HWHlb8JZ2w/VVH0oYd2BpyQFLn\n4Pz8tuo77tImVvbHOxCt