llection`; add size, productType,\n  framework, status, component, context filters\n- Add `collection` and `detail` (summary | full) to get\n- Enrich responses with next.suggested_call hints, related blocks,\n  and resolved_via on get\n- Update SearchOptions and SearchResult; add findComponentsRelatedToExample\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): switch data source to docs generator and wire search filters\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): include stable in status enum\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): add query param to suggested next-call\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): make data dir resolution work from scripts and assert in smoke test\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): regenerate data from updated generator\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): regenerate data after extract-api fix\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): normalize component filter and honor collection in get\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): regenerate data after generator fixes","tree":{"sha":"1c6a1745af749d322306db8ac1e959568c7cbb45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GovAlta/dcp-monorepo/git/trees/1c6a1745af749d322306db8ac1e959568c7cbb45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/GovAlta/dcp-monorepo/git/commits/1df17027d7f6dde761188265bbce6252c2e897a7","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c6a1745af749d322306db8ac1e959568c7cbb45\nparent 5d6584341a542a9227fcec3b3824f6ac48404259\nauthor Thomas Jeffery <82968683+twjeffery@users.noreply.github.com> 1779818405 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779818405 -0600\n\nchore(design-system-mcp): switch data source to docs generator and wire search filters\n\n* chore(design-system-mcp): tighten search and get tool surface\n\n- Rewrite descriptions for search and get following Linear''s recipe\n  (one-liner job statement, inline value mappings, response shape preview)\n- Replace search''s `type` with `collection`; add size, productType,\n  framework, status, component, context filters\n- Add `collection` and `detail` (summary | full) to get\n- Enrich responses with next.suggested_call hin